# DCIM Compliance Dashboard

## Project Overview
Global Infrastructure Command Center monitoring 11,992 facilities from 118 providers using edge-inclusive methodology.

## Tech Stack
- React 18+ with TypeScript
- Vite build system
- Tailwind CSS (static classes only - NO dynamic classes)
- IndexedDB via Dexie.js (NO localStorage/sessionStorage)
- Cloudflare Pages deployment

## Critical Safety Rules
1. **NO localStorage/sessionStorage** - Use IndexedDB via Dexie.js only
2. **NO dynamic Tailwind classes** - Use static classes or inline styles
3. **NO HTML form elements in React** - Use onClick handlers
4. **Files under 50KB** - Split large components
5. **useEffect must have cleanup** - Return cleanup functions

## File Structure
- /src/components/ - React components
- /src/hooks/ - Custom hooks
- /src/utils/ - Utility functions
- /docs/ - Documentation

## Commands
- npm run dev - Local development
- npm run build - Production build
- npm run preview - Preview build locally
